Content from the German Wikipedia
=================================

Files in this directory contain text from the German Wikipedia
(https://de.wikipedia.org). The text is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.de

Authors: the authors of the respective articles. The author list is available
in the version history of each article on de.wikipedia.org. Every fixture file
records the article title and revision ID (revid) it was taken from, so the
revision permalink and its history can be found.

Changes: fixtures may be shortened or reformatted for use in tests.

The CC BY-SA 4.0 terms apply to these files and to adaptations of them.
The full licence text is in ../../../archive/LICENSE.
The licence of the rest of the repository (Apache 2.0) does not apply to the
files in this directory.
